"""Mixed-background passages: several naming systems in one scene (cross-cultural casts, isekai, modern). Original prose."""

PASSAGES = [
("mix01", """[[Elena Petrova|p]] met [[Wang Lei|p]] outside the conference hall in [[Singapore|l]]. “[[Dr. Petrova|p|tit]],” he said, “[[Prof. Okonkwo|p|tit]] sends regards.” “[[Wang-laoshi|p|tit]], please.” “[[Lei|p]] is fine.” The [[Pacific Biotech Forum|o]] had invited three hundred guests, and two of them carried the same family name, [[Okonkwo|p]]. Nobody could tell which [[Okonkwo|p]] was speaking at ten. “Hope you slept,” laughed [[Elena|p]]. Rain pounded the glass."""),
("mix02", """Heaven and earth were quiet. [[Luo Qing|p]], a cultivator from [[Cloud Peak|l]], had somehow been summoned to the kingdom of [[Elmoria|l|inv]], where [[Sir Percival|p|tit]] called him [[Lord Luo|p|tit]]. “Which [[Luo|p]]?” asked the king. “[[Luo Qing|p]],” said the knight. “[[Qing-ge|p|tit]],” whispered a servant. The [[Royal Order of the Rose|o]] had never met a sect elder. The sword he carried, [[Frost Whisper|i]], hummed with confusion. The king, called [[His Majesty|t|ali]] by court and [[Old Hal|p|ali]] by his wife, laughed."""),
("mix03", """[[Joy|p|si]] and [[Hope|p|wl]] worked at the same ward of [[St. Anne's Hospital|l]]. [[Joy Mukherjee|p|wl]] and [[Hope Park|p|wl]] were friends. “[[Nurse Joy|p|tit]],” called a patient, “[[Nurse Hope|p|tit]] says come.” The doctor, [[Dr. Tanaka|p|tit]], laughed. “[[Mukherjee-san|p|tit]], [[Park-ssi|p|tit]], the ward round.” The [[head nurse|t]], a stern woman known as [[Matron Okoye|p|tit]], inspected beds. On the wall hung a poster for the [[Global Health Alliance|o]]. Rain streaked the windows, and a baby cried."""),
("mix04", """[[Hana Kim|p]], [[Kim Hana|p]], and [[Hana-chan|p|tit]] were the same girl in three countries. In [[Seoul|l]] she was [[Hana-ssi|p|tit]]; in [[Osaka|l]], [[Kim-san|p|tit]]; online, [[Starfall|p|ali]]. “[[Starfall|p|ali]] is streaming,” said a fan. The [[Moonlit Esports Club|o]] had signed her last winter. The coach, [[Coach Barros|p|tit]], from [[Sao Paulo|l]], spoke four languages poorly. “[[Hana|p]], focus.” She adjusted her headset and the match began."""),
("mix05", """[[Sun|p|si]] and [[Moon|p|wl]] were the names of two market cats in [[Marrakesh|l]], and also of two clerks at the [[Souk Trading Company|o]]. [[Sun|p|wl]] and [[Moon|p|wl]] shared a desk. “[[Sun|p|wl]],” said [[Mr. Haddad|p|tit]], “where is [[Moon|p|wl]]?” “Feeding the cats.” “Which?” “Both.” The [[director|t]] of the company, a thin man called [[Si Bensouda|p|tit]], smiled at the confusion. Through the arch of [[Bab Agnaou|l]] came the smell of cumin and rain."""),
("mix06", """The [[Wanderer's Inn|l]] was full of strangers. [[Fang Yuan|p]] drank tea beside [[Sir Roland|p|tit]], while [[Kiran|p]] and [[Aiko|p]] argued over dice. “[[Fang-ge|p|tit]],” said [[Aiko|p]], “you owe me.” “[[Kiran-ji|p|tit]] won.” In the corner, the innkeeper, [[Old Marta|p|tit]], counted coins and a cat named [[Rain|p|wl]] slept on her lap. “[[Marta|p]],” said [[Roland|p]], “a room.” “All rooms taken.” The [[Seven Roads Guild|o]] had booked the whole floor."""),
("mix07", """[[Sophie Laurent|p]] translated the old chronicle. In it, a [[sect master|t]] named [[Wu Han|p]] befriended a Sultan, [[Harun|p]], and a Viking, [[Eirik|p]]. Odd company, she thought, and sure to be invented. At the [[Sorbonne Library|o]], her colleague [[Prof. Dubois|p|tit]] disagreed. “[[Dubois|p]],” she said, “look at the [[Silk Road Ledger|i]]. Three scripts, one hand.” “[[Sophie-san|p|tit]],” he joked, “you are too clever.” Outside, snow dusted the roofs of [[Paris|l]], and the clock tower struck noon."""),
("mix08", """Dust blew over [[Karakorum Camp|l]]. [[Temujin|p]] was only a boy then, called [[Temu|p|ali]] by his mother, and [[Boy-with-Blue-Eyes|t|ali]] by the older warriors. “[[Temujin|p]],” said [[Jamukha|p]], “the [[khan|t|sh]] calls.” “Which [[khan|t|sh]]?” There were two: one over the [[Merkit|o]], one over the [[Tayichiud|o]]. [[Jamukha|p]] shrugged. The two boys ran across the steppe, carrying a bone token called the [[Eagle Knuckle|i]], and the grass bent in waves behind them."""),
("mix09", """“[[Ghost|p|wl]],” said the pilot, “drop in.” [[Ghost|p|wl]] was the callsign of [[Lt. Amara Osei|p|tit]], who had never been to [[Accra|l]] but whose parents were from there. The squadron, the [[Blue Falcons|o]], flew from [[Station Delphi|l|inv]]. Her wingman, [[Dev|p]], called her [[Lieutenant|t|ali]] when angry, [[Osei|p]] when calm. The [[colonel|t]] watched from the tower. “[[Ghost|p|wl]] and [[Dev|p]], the [[Silver Corridor|l|inv]] is yours.” Engines roared, and the sky filled with light."""),
("mix10", """[[Master Yin|p|tit]] and [[Sister Maria|p|tit]] shared the courtyard of the [[Lotus and Cross Mission|o]]. The monastery's old bell, [[Gentle Thunder|i]], marked hours for both. “[[Yin-shifu|p|tit]],” said the novice, [[Brother Tomas|p|tit]], “the rain has soaked the garden.” “[[Maria|p]] will mend it.” “[[Sister|t|ali]] is mending the roof.” The [[abbot|t|sh]] of the Cross wing and the [[abbot|t|sh]] of the Lotus wing met at supper and said nothing. Over [[Hanoi|l]], the evening clouds were purple."""),
]
